flowchart LR
    accTitle: Implemented amends reference architecture
    accDescr: One PostgreSQL worker transaction commits a decision. The relay publishes asynchronously with at-least-once delivery. Independent verification compares retained source history with the view at a complete boundary.
    G["Generator<br/>Tiny staged fixture<br/>Optional seeded histories"] --> I["Source topic<br/>Retained raw history<br/>Keyed by stock key"]
    I --> W["Workers x2<br/>Revision authority<br/>Rewind, refold, diff"]
    subgraph TX["Atomic worker decision"]
        W --> P["Postgres<br/>State, versions, quarantine<br/>Outbox, position, epoch"]
    end
    P --> R["Relay<br/>Publish stored envelope<br/>Acknowledge, then mark sent"]
    R --> O["Output topic<br/>Balances, crossings, withdrawals<br/>Key status; at-least-once transport"]
    O --> V["View<br/>Durable highest version per ID<br/>Retained withdrawals and own progress"]
    I -. "Complete source prefix H" .-> C["amendsctl<br/>Independent batch oracle<br/>Bounded verify, inspect, replay, rebuild"]
    V -. "Current state at output boundary O" .-> C
    P -. "Epoch / progress / outbox completion" .-> C
    M["Observability: source and view lag; rewind cost; outbox age; conflicts; complete verification status"]
    classDef default fill:#ffffff,stroke:#d8ddd9,color:#17232b
    style TX fill:#eaf0eb,stroke:#245c50,color:#245c50
    linkStyle default stroke:#50616b
